OpenADR Alliance material
-------------------------

The OpenADR 2.0a and 2.0b profile specifications and schemas and the
OpenADR 3.1.0 definition (OpenAPI YAML and documents) are copyright the
OpenADR Alliance, all rights reserved. None of them is included in this
module: element names, namespaces, response codes, paths, field names,
enumerations and conformance rules are used as facts, in our own words
with section and rule references. The XML schemas (oadr_20a.xsd,
oadr_20b.xsd and the files they include) are not redistributable and
are not here; oadr2b.LoadSchemas reads a copy the user supplies at run
time, and the tests that need one take it from SIGMA_TEST_OPENADR_XSD_DIR
or, in the interop module, copy OpenLEADR's copy out of its container
into a temporary directory when they run.

