Interop tests (interop/, a separate test-only module)
-----------------------------------------------------

interop/peer/openleadr/Dockerfile installs OpenLEADR 0.5.36
(openleadr-python, Apache-2.0, Copyright 2020 Contributors to
OpenLEADR) and its dependencies from PyPI into a python:3.12.10-slim
image at test time. interop/peer/openleadr-rs/Dockerfile clones
openleadr-rs at tag v0.2.6 (Apache-2.0 or MIT, Copyright (c) 2024
Stichting ElaadNL and Contributors) and builds it at test time; the
tests load openleadr-rs's own user fixtures from that image into a
postgres:16 container. Nothing of either project is copied into this
repository. interop/peer/openleadr/check.py and make.py are our own
scripts that call OpenLEADR's functions.

Test data
---------

VEN and VTN IDs, market contexts, URLs, keys and certificates in the
tests and the examples are made-up demo values or are generated when
the tests run. The client IDs and secrets in interop/oadr3_test.go are
those of openleadr-rs's public test fixtures.
